'''Steel Saviors''' (鋼の救世主, ''Hagane no Meshia'', '''Steel Messiah''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]].

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

